OL,3,GNEWSAHusband fulfils late wife's wish
OL,4,Ato help abuse victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA husband has fulfilled his late wife's
OL,7,Fwish for toiletry washbags she made
OL,8,Fbefore she died to be given to domestic
OL,9,Fabuse victims.
OL,11,FJulie Parsons from Staffordshire made
OL,12,Fabout 25 bags which she planned to fill
OL,13,Fwith essential items for victims but
OL,14,Fdied in 2021.
OL,16,FThey remained in the home she lived in
OL,17,Fwith her husband Rod, but after a staff
OL,18,Fmember from a Wolverhampton domestic
OL,19,Fabuse charity recently stayed at his
OL,20,FAirbnb, they "got chatting" and Rod has
OL,21,Fnow been able to donate them.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
