OL,3,GNEWSAHusband fulfils late wife's wish
OL,4,Ato help abuse victims
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was really nice and I was really
OL,7,Fpleased to pass them on for the reason
OL,8,Fthey were made in the first place,
OL,9,Frather than just sitting in the back of
OL,10,Fa wardrobe," Rod said.
